"No changes. Try another step or adjust the workflow." = "文本没有变化。可以尝试其他步骤或调整工作流。";
"Cancel preview" = "取消预览";
"Preview result" = "预览结果";
"Close" = "关闭";
"Apply to draft" = "应用到草稿";
