"Enable step" = "启用步骤";
"Operation" = "操作";
"Move step up" = "上移步骤";
"Move step down" = "下移步骤";
"Remove step" = "删除步骤";
"Find (literal text)" = "查找（普通文本）";
"Replace with" = "替换为";
"Add step" = "添加步骤";
"Line steps use LF line endings; sorting uses exact UTF-8 order." = "行处理会统一为 LF 换行；排序按 UTF-8 字节顺序。";
"Test text" = "测试文本";
"Before" = "原文";
"After" = "结果";
"Run a preview to see the result here." = "运行预览后，结果将显示在这里。";
"Preview shows the first 12,000 characters. Apply uses the complete result." = "预览显示前 12,000 个字符，应用时会使用完整结果。";
"Clean up text, sort lines and format JSON inside Clipy. Save reusable steps here, then run them from Edit Content." = "直接在 Clipy 内整理文本、排序行和格式化 JSON。在这里保存常用步骤，即可从「编辑内容」中运行。";
"Manage workflows…" = "管理工作流…";
"Text exceeds the 1 MiB workflow limit. Shorten the text or reduce replacement expansion." = "文本超过工作流的 1 MiB 上限。请缩短文本或减少替换扩展。";
"Use no more than 32 steps in one workflow." = "每个工作流最多支持 32 个步骤。";
"Line operations support up to 50,000 lines. Shorten the text before running this workflow." = "行处理最多支持 50,000 行，请缩短文本后再运行此工作流。";
"Enter text to find, or disable the replacement step." = "请输入要查找的文本，或停用替换步骤。";
"This text is not valid JSON. Correct the source text or disable the JSON step, then preview again." = "文本不是有效的 JSON。请修改原文或停用 JSON 步骤，再重新预览。";
"Give this workflow a name and at least one step." = "请为工作流命名，并添加至少一个步骤。";
"Saved workflows could not be read. Your saved data is unchanged. Reset saved workflows to start again." = "无法读取已保存的工作流，原数据未改动。可重置已保存的工作流以重新开始。";
"You can save up to 50 workflows. Remove one before saving another." = "最多可保存 50 个工作流。请删除一个后再保存。";
